WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.580
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.850 --> 01:48.000
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.120 --> 01:50.990
[Episode 12]

4
01:51.900 --> 01:54.030
I thought about it all night back home.

5
01:58.950 --> 02:00.880
I've decided to think it over again

6
02:02.140 --> 02:04.140
before deciding whether to give up.

7
02:34.780 --> 02:35.430
Didn't expect Yun Li

8
02:35.430 --> 02:36.760
to be this kind of person.

9
02:36.760 --> 02:37.680
This is surprising.

10
02:37.680 --> 02:39.530
I can't see Yun Li doing something like that.

11
02:39.530 --> 02:42.240
She's not the way people online make her out to be.

12
02:42.240 --> 02:43.150
What are you guys talking about?

13
02:43.150 --> 02:44.030
Sounds lively.

14
02:44.360 --> 02:44.900
Nothing.

15
02:44.900 --> 02:46.100
Just some work stuff.

16
02:47.360 --> 02:48.180
Let me see.

17
02:48.840 --> 02:50.560
Anyway, the process has reached your stage now.

18
02:50.560 --> 02:51.130
Look.

19
02:51.560 --> 02:52.130
Alright.

20
02:52.130 --> 02:53.740
How about you approve it first?

21
02:53.740 --> 02:54.530
I'll wrap it up

22
02:54.530 --> 02:56.079
and show you this afternoon.

23
02:56.079 --> 02:56.579
Okay,

24
02:56.780 --> 02:58.310
I'll go talk to the manager

25
02:58.310 --> 02:59.180
about this again.

26
02:59.180 --> 02:59.690
Okay.

27
03:11.630 --> 03:13.280
Did you see that photo taken at our company?

28
03:13.280 --> 03:14.240
That's her?

29
03:23.190 --> 03:23.980
[Famous content creator Idle Cloud Tick-Tock played dirty for promotion—]

30
03:23.980 --> 03:24.780
[she seduced the boss's relative and engaged in workplace bullying.]

31
03:29.410 --> 03:30.370
No way.

32
03:30.370 --> 03:32.000
I think she makes good videos.

33
03:32.000 --> 03:33.410
Can't believe she's this kind of person.

34
03:33.410 --> 03:34.250
What the heck?

35
03:34.360 --> 03:35.150
Can they ban

36
03:35.150 --> 03:35.960
this kind of

37
03:35.960 --> 03:37.180
toxic content creator?

38
03:37.180 --> 03:38.690
You used despicable means to climb up the ladder,

39
03:38.690 --> 03:39.950
and now you're hiding?

40
03:40.250 --> 03:41.970
Morally corrupt and despicable.

41
03:41.970 --> 03:42.870
You reap what you sow.

42
03:42.870 --> 03:44.500
Apologize for your mistakes.

43
03:44.500 --> 03:45.860
You resorted to any means necessary to get ahead

44
03:45.860 --> 03:46.710
and bullied others.

45
03:46.710 --> 03:48.210
You don't deserve to be a content creator!

46
03:48.210 --> 03:50.070
Who would like someone like this?

47
03:53.130 --> 03:54.430
No wonder she's always

48
03:54.430 --> 03:55.560
coming around here.

49
03:55.560 --> 03:57.460
Turns out she comes for Shize.

50
03:57.460 --> 03:58.840
Isn't it obvious?

51
03:58.930 --> 03:59.690
She's been bringing him

52
03:59.690 --> 04:01.620
breakfast several days straight.

53
04:18.560 --> 04:19.360
Ms. Fang.

54
04:19.740 --> 04:20.380
Thank you.

55
04:20.529 --> 04:21.320
What is it that

56
04:21.320 --> 04:22.600
we couldn't talk about at the office

57
04:22.600 --> 04:23.930
and had to meet here?

58
04:26.430 --> 04:28.560
The online rumors about me

59
04:28.680 --> 04:31.040
have caused quite a stir at the office.

60
04:31.930 --> 04:33.250
It's had a negative impact

61
04:33.250 --> 04:34.240
on the company.

62
04:34.350 --> 04:35.680
I'm very sorry for that.

63
04:36.500 --> 04:37.300
I...

64
04:37.830 --> 04:39.159
I'll give you a week off.

65
04:39.250 --> 04:40.909
Go back and get some good rest.

66
04:41.240 --> 04:43.600
Okay. Thank you, Ms. Fang.

67
04:45.860 --> 04:46.659
Yun Li,

68
04:46.930 --> 04:47.930
our company won't let

69
04:47.930 --> 04:49.760
these rumors spread unchecked.

70
04:49.860 --> 04:50.890
We trust you.

71
04:52.010 --> 04:53.210
Being misunderstood

72
04:53.560 --> 04:55.180
is just part of working life.

73
04:55.560 --> 04:56.960
You need to get used to it.

74
04:57.100 --> 04:57.860
We can't control

75
04:57.860 --> 04:58.950
what others think,

76
04:58.950 --> 04:59.800
so try

77
05:00.240 --> 05:01.840
to manage your own emotions.

78
05:02.430 --> 05:03.490
As the saying goes,

79
05:03.930 --> 05:05.160
don't let words you can't see

80
05:05.160 --> 05:07.190
bring down the life you're living.

81
05:07.560 --> 05:09.220
I'm sharing it with you today.

82
05:09.530 --> 05:10.660
Thank you, Ms. Fang.

83
05:20.330 --> 05:21.450
Mind your step.

84
05:21.600 --> 05:22.390
I'm okay.

85
05:25.860 --> 05:26.800
Welcome.

86
05:28.060 --> 05:29.390
What are you doing here?

87
05:29.540 --> 05:30.670
I'm interning here.

88
05:55.720 --> 05:56.420
Shize,

89
05:56.430 --> 05:57.060
hello.

90
06:06.740 --> 06:07.540
Yuan,

91
06:09.990 --> 06:11.020
long time no see.

92
06:11.870 --> 06:12.930
"Long time no see"?

93
06:13.220 --> 06:16.020
Has it been a long time since we last saw each other?

94
06:19.800 --> 06:20.600
Nope.

95
06:23.540 --> 06:24.660
It's just that I'm

96
06:26.300 --> 06:27.430
so happy to see you.

97
06:28.450 --> 06:29.580
I'm very happy, too.

98
06:30.300 --> 06:32.000
If anything makes you happy

99
06:32.100 --> 06:33.450
or bothers you,

100
06:33.790 --> 06:35.130
feel free to share it with me.

101
06:35.130 --> 06:37.460
I'm always here to answer your questions.

102
06:44.540 --> 06:45.250
The best thing

103
06:45.250 --> 06:46.980
that's happened to me recently

104
06:53.060 --> 06:53.860
is that I met

105
06:53.860 --> 06:54.920
a really nice girl.

106
06:56.100 --> 06:57.950
I'm truly happy for you.

107
06:58.630 --> 07:00.890
Is "really nice" just pure admiration,

108
07:01.300 --> 07:04.360
or does it make you imagine

109
07:05.100 --> 07:07.300
what might be possible between you two?

110
07:08.450 --> 07:09.650
I dare not imagine it.

111
07:10.500 --> 07:11.300
Why?

112
07:18.130 --> 07:19.660
In my current state, I am...

113
07:23.330 --> 07:24.930
not the right person for her.

114
07:28.740 --> 07:29.890
I'll only hurt her.

115
07:33.930 --> 07:35.930
I don't want to hold her back either.

116
07:36.600 --> 07:37.360
If you feel that

117
07:37.360 --> 07:38.750
you've run into a problem,

118
07:38.750 --> 07:40.159
try looking at it

119
07:40.159 --> 07:41.630
from a different perspective

120
07:41.630 --> 07:43.360
and see if you can make a change.

121
07:45.360 --> 07:46.130
But I...

122
07:46.130 --> 07:47.100
If you've run into...

123
07:47.100 --> 07:48.240
into a problem...

124
07:49.250 --> 07:51.430
If you feel that you've run into a problem,

125
07:51.430 --> 07:53.100
you... you... you...

126
07:53.130 --> 07:54.630
try looking...

127
07:54.630 --> 07:56.090
if you can make a change...

128
07:59.250 --> 08:00.830
Try looking at... make a change...

129
08:00.830 --> 08:01.760
Make a change...

130
08:02.240 --> 08:03.040
Yuan?

131
08:04.830 --> 08:05.630
Yuan?

132
08:21.100 --> 08:21.890
"Change"?

133
08:34.440 --> 08:35.240
Who is the lunatic

134
08:35.240 --> 08:35.789
talking

135
08:35.789 --> 08:36.840
such nonsense?

136
08:36.840 --> 08:38.360
Aren't they afraid of karma?

137
08:38.360 --> 08:39.460
And those netizens, too.

138
08:39.460 --> 08:40.100
We should fire back

139
08:40.100 --> 08:41.630
at every single one of them.

140
08:41.890 --> 08:42.549
Lili,

141
08:42.549 --> 08:44.340
netizens just believe whatever they hear.

142
08:44.340 --> 08:45.600
Don't take it to heart.

143
08:46.740 --> 08:48.030
I also told Qingsong

144
08:48.030 --> 08:49.500
to look into it at the company

145
08:49.500 --> 08:50.290
and see who on earth

146
08:50.290 --> 08:51.440
is behind all this.

147
08:52.740 --> 08:53.530
Tangy,

148
08:53.530 --> 08:54.150
take

149
08:54.150 --> 08:55.500
the next couple of days off

150
08:55.500 --> 08:57.160
and spend more time with Lili.

151
08:59.210 --> 09:01.180
You're working at the guesthouse now?

152
09:01.180 --> 09:02.940
I didn't have a chance to tell you.

153
09:02.940 --> 09:03.630
Lili,

154
09:03.630 --> 09:04.940
I agree with Xia.

155
09:04.940 --> 09:06.030
Take a couple of days off,

156
09:06.030 --> 09:07.650
and I'll take you out to help you relax.

157
09:07.650 --> 09:08.700
In your current state,

158
09:08.700 --> 09:10.500
you probably can't work anyway.

159
09:11.170 --> 09:12.920
I've already asked for leave.

160
09:13.290 --> 09:15.350
I plan to go back to Xifu for a few days.

161
09:15.740 --> 09:17.200
You're going back to Xifu?

162
09:18.700 --> 09:19.630
It's good to go back.

163
09:19.630 --> 09:20.250
You haven't

164
09:20.250 --> 09:22.050
been home for a long time, right?

165
09:22.700 --> 09:24.050
But even so,

166
09:24.240 --> 09:25.630
what if your dad keeps you in Xifu

167
09:25.630 --> 09:27.250
and doesn't let you come back?

168
09:27.250 --> 09:28.360
He won't.

169
09:28.500 --> 09:29.600
Don't worry.

170
09:30.250 --> 09:30.860
I'm...

171
09:30.860 --> 09:32.120
I'm leaving tomorrow.

172
09:34.890 --> 09:36.220
I'm going to take a call.

173
09:38.100 --> 09:39.360
So you're leaving tomorrow.

174
09:39.360 --> 09:40.790
Have you told Fu Shize?

175
09:42.200 --> 09:43.340
Tell him what?

176
09:43.800 --> 09:46.000
Tell him that you're going back to Xifu!

177
10:42.860 --> 10:44.150
I'm going back to Xifu.

178
11:16.600 --> 11:17.800
Come on, have a drink.

179
11:26.360 --> 11:27.820
The view isn't even great.

180
11:28.050 --> 11:29.710
What's got you so captivated?

181
11:31.050 --> 11:32.710
It was really hard to find you.

182
11:32.960 --> 11:34.120
You didn't answer calls,

183
11:34.120 --> 11:35.290
so I had to text you.

184
11:40.550 --> 11:41.360
What's wrong?

185
11:43.440 --> 11:44.240
Upset?

186
11:45.840 --> 11:46.740
Come on,

187
11:46.890 --> 11:47.550
you bottle

188
11:47.550 --> 11:48.740
everything up and don't tell anyone

189
11:48.740 --> 11:50.000
what's bothering you.

190
11:50.240 --> 11:52.700
How would anyone know if you don't tell them?

191
11:55.550 --> 11:56.750
What brings you here?

192
11:57.050 --> 11:58.360
I came to chat with you.

193
12:02.740 --> 12:04.340
I have nothing to chat about.

194
12:04.390 --> 12:05.200
But I have.

195
12:06.550 --> 12:07.460
Have you heard about

196
12:07.460 --> 12:09.260
the recent gossip at the office?

197
12:09.890 --> 12:10.860
I knew it.

198
12:11.130 --> 12:12.120
You're always so late to the online buzz.

199
12:12.120 --> 12:13.260
How would you know?

200
12:14.150 --> 12:15.810
I'm not interested in gossip.

201
12:18.650 --> 12:20.450
What if it's about you and Yun Li?

202
12:20.840 --> 12:22.100
Still not interested?

203
12:23.840 --> 12:25.150
Here, check this out.

204
12:32.280 --> 12:33.760
[Famous content creator Idle Cloud Tick-Tock played dirty for promotion—]

205
12:33.760 --> 12:35.240
[she seduced the boss's relative and engaged in workplace bullying.]

206
12:36.240 --> 12:37.000
Did you know that Yun Li

207
12:37.000 --> 12:37.930
asked for leave?

208
12:40.050 --> 12:41.450
I heard from Jiameng that

209
12:41.650 --> 12:43.510
Yun Li has lost a lot of followers.

210
12:44.390 --> 12:45.150
The content creators

211
12:45.150 --> 12:46.250
who did store reviews with her before

212
12:46.250 --> 12:47.850
have all stayed silent, too.

213
12:48.100 --> 12:49.000
I think this must

214
12:49.000 --> 12:50.060
have hurt her a lot.

215
12:57.100 --> 12:58.500
I'll handle this matter.

216
13:02.520 --> 13:03.070
Okay.

217
13:09.000 --> 13:09.650
Are you upset

218
13:09.650 --> 13:11.290
because of Yun Li?

219
13:13.050 --> 13:14.240
Don't try to deny it.

220
13:14.460 --> 13:15.860
Don't think I can't tell.

221
13:16.550 --> 13:17.290
You two have made it

222
13:17.290 --> 13:18.750
so obvious at the office.

223
13:18.890 --> 13:20.510
Anyone can tell.

224
13:23.280 --> 13:24.080
What's wrong?

225
13:25.030 --> 13:26.630
It has nothing to do with you.

226
13:27.890 --> 13:29.750
Fine, it has nothing to do with me.

227
13:32.430 --> 13:33.440
How is it going

228
13:33.460 --> 13:34.790
with your digital twin?

229
13:36.530 --> 13:37.990
It can now appear on screen

230
13:38.340 --> 13:39.740
and hold a conversation.

231
13:40.960 --> 13:41.750
Really?

232
13:42.550 --> 13:44.610
Well... Does that count as a success?

233
13:44.860 --> 13:45.650
Nope.

234
13:46.460 --> 13:48.190
The imaging is still unstable.

235
13:49.530 --> 13:51.390
I still need to keep working on it.

236
13:51.530 --> 13:52.240
Being able to generate an image

237
13:52.240 --> 13:54.040
is already a huge breakthrough.

238
13:54.360 --> 13:55.250
I believe

239
13:55.500 --> 13:56.700
it won't take you long

240
13:56.700 --> 13:57.960
to make it work.

241
13:58.650 --> 13:59.740
Anyway, the Light Chaser

242
13:59.740 --> 14:00.940
is already finished.

243
14:01.030 --> 14:01.700
You can just focus

244
14:01.700 --> 14:03.360
on your digital twin project.

245
14:04.900 --> 14:05.700
By the way,

246
14:05.860 --> 14:07.190
there's one more thing.

247
14:07.290 --> 14:08.840
XUST recently established

248
14:08.840 --> 14:10.030
a VR research lab.

249
14:10.150 --> 14:11.740
They need to purchase a batch of devices,

250
14:11.740 --> 14:14.470
so they've invited us to a bidding presentation.

251
14:15.290 --> 14:16.090
Are you going?

252
14:17.890 --> 14:18.700
I...

253
14:24.010 --> 14:25.140
I'll think about it.

254
15:01.460 --> 15:02.240
I never expected

255
15:02.240 --> 15:04.080
Idle Cloud Tick-Tock to be this kind of person!

256
15:04.080 --> 15:05.600
She did whatever it took to climb up the ladder

257
15:05.600 --> 15:07.130
and bullied others at the office!

258
15:07.130 --> 15:09.120
Sleeping your way to the top

259
15:09.120 --> 15:10.910
is utterly shameful behavior!

260
15:10.910 --> 15:12.250
She bullied others at work.

261
15:12.250 --> 15:12.960
Her actions

262
15:12.960 --> 15:13.940
are truly disgusting!

263
15:13.940 --> 15:14.720
Unsubscribed.

264
15:14.720 --> 15:15.480
Such a person

265
15:15.480 --> 15:17.170
doesn't deserve fans' support at all!

266
15:17.170 --> 15:18.200
Unsubscribed!

267
15:18.220 --> 15:20.020
Does she even have a conscience?

268
15:20.030 --> 15:21.250
I hope she pays

269
15:21.250 --> 15:22.180
for her actions!

270
15:28.340 --> 15:29.130
Lili,

271
15:29.450 --> 15:30.800
it's your favorite ginger duck.

272
15:30.800 --> 15:31.690
Have some more.

273
15:32.670 --> 15:33.270
Li,

274
15:33.840 --> 15:35.840
why did you come back all of a sudden?

275
15:40.530 --> 15:41.340
I just finished my exams,

276
15:41.340 --> 15:42.870
so I'm taking a few days off.

277
15:43.370 --> 15:44.340
Didn't you keep calling

278
15:44.340 --> 15:45.800
and asking me to come back?

279
15:45.910 --> 15:46.980
That's true.

280
15:48.510 --> 15:49.620
You've been away for so long

281
15:49.620 --> 15:50.870
and didn't even come home.

282
15:50.870 --> 15:51.980
And you didn't even call to tell us

283
15:51.980 --> 15:53.440
that you were coming back.

284
15:56.120 --> 15:56.870
Lili,

285
15:56.870 --> 15:58.530
are you used to the food there?

286
15:58.740 --> 15:59.530
Yes.

287
16:00.220 --> 16:01.530
Our cafeteria serves all kinds of food.

288
16:01.530 --> 16:02.790
It's very convenient.

289
16:02.820 --> 16:04.080
Food is just one aspect.

290
16:04.080 --> 16:04.670
Yes.

291
16:04.670 --> 16:07.030
Well, are you used to living there?

292
16:07.270 --> 16:08.670
Her place is really nice!

293
16:08.730 --> 16:10.790
Even I want to go and rent a room there.

294
16:12.630 --> 16:13.740
How is the school?

295
16:14.220 --> 16:15.820
Are you getting along well with your teachers

296
16:15.820 --> 16:17.130
and classmates?

297
16:17.710 --> 16:18.430
Very well!

298
16:18.500 --> 16:19.690
Isn't Tang Lin there?

299
16:19.690 --> 16:20.750
Did anyone ask you?

300
16:23.510 --> 16:24.320
How is your...

301
16:24.740 --> 16:25.870
your internship

302
16:26.120 --> 16:27.170
going?

303
16:27.340 --> 16:29.670
Did anyone make things difficult for you?

304
16:29.910 --> 16:30.720
No.

305
16:30.980 --> 16:31.670
Really,

306
16:31.670 --> 16:33.530
i-it's pretty good. Really nice.

307
16:33.940 --> 16:35.120
I just missed home,

308
16:35.120 --> 16:35.820
so I came back.

309
16:35.820 --> 16:37.150
I missed Mom's cooking.

310
16:37.340 --> 16:39.330
You can come back anytime you miss home!

311
16:39.330 --> 16:41.190
Now you know home is better, huh?

312
16:42.080 --> 16:43.220
I think you should just

313
16:43.220 --> 16:44.740
stay in Xifu since you're back this time.

314
16:44.740 --> 16:46.470
Just settle in and take it easy.

315
16:46.740 --> 16:47.820
Listen...

316
16:48.060 --> 16:49.120
Your dad means that

317
16:49.270 --> 16:50.030
it's inevitable

318
16:50.030 --> 16:52.340
to feel uncomfortable sometimes when you are away from home.

319
16:52.340 --> 16:53.220
But home

320
16:53.630 --> 16:55.670
will always be your safe haven.

321
17:01.320 --> 17:02.030
I see that you're unhappy

322
17:02.030 --> 17:03.530
studying in Nanwu.

323
17:03.670 --> 17:04.440
Why don't you come back

324
17:04.440 --> 17:06.109
and take the postgraduate exam in Xifu again?

325
17:06.109 --> 17:07.880
Don't you really like XUST?

326
17:09.740 --> 17:10.530
Dear,

327
17:10.920 --> 17:12.369
give this ginger duck

328
17:12.390 --> 17:12.829
a try.

329
17:12.829 --> 17:14.430
See if I cooked it well today.

330
18:01.220 --> 18:02.180
Hello, Tangy.

331
18:02.810 --> 18:04.010
Are you home, Lili?

332
18:04.240 --> 18:04.940
Yes, I'm home.

333
18:04.940 --> 18:06.600
I've already finished lunch.

334
18:06.940 --> 18:08.220
Did your dad scold you?

335
18:09.190 --> 18:11.170
Isn't he always like that?

336
18:12.880 --> 18:14.740
How is it? Are your legs still intact?

337
18:14.740 --> 18:15.830
What's wrong with my legs?

338
18:15.830 --> 18:16.580
Didn't your dad claim

339
18:16.580 --> 18:18.980
that he'd break your legs when you got home?

340
18:20.110 --> 18:20.880
They're intact.

341
18:20.880 --> 18:22.480
I can still jump around.

342
18:22.940 --> 18:24.570
There doesn't seem to be any big problem.

343
18:24.570 --> 18:25.850
I can rest easy now.

344
18:25.880 --> 18:27.020
Call me if you need anything.

345
18:27.020 --> 18:27.880
I'm hanging up.

346
18:27.980 --> 18:28.770
Bye-bye.

347
18:40.010 --> 18:41.900
She just used her beauty to climb up the ladder.

348
18:41.900 --> 18:43.220
How shameless.

349
18:43.720 --> 18:45.010
Is this person...

350
18:45.810 --> 18:47.290
How rude!

351
18:49.190 --> 18:51.140
Idle Cloud is beautiful as she is!

352
18:53.760 --> 18:55.980
You're slacking off at work and playing on your phone?

353
18:55.980 --> 18:57.070
None of your business.

354
18:57.070 --> 18:57.970
You're not the boss.

355
18:57.970 --> 18:59.030
Go jump in the lake.

356
18:59.270 --> 19:00.070
Then who am I?

357
19:00.640 --> 19:01.440
Fu Zhengchu.

358
19:01.510 --> 19:02.570
Who is my sister?

359
19:02.950 --> 19:03.660
Xia Congsheng.

360
19:03.660 --> 19:04.340
Exactly!

361
19:04.360 --> 19:05.640
She's my sister, and I'm her brother.

362
19:05.640 --> 19:06.770
What's hers is mine.

363
19:07.880 --> 19:09.030
You two don't even share the same family name!

364
19:09.030 --> 19:09.680
So what?

365
19:09.680 --> 19:11.280
She is my biological sister.

366
19:11.590 --> 19:11.880
You...

367
19:11.880 --> 19:13.630
A gentleman doesn't fight a woman.

368
19:13.630 --> 19:15.090
Can you show even a little respect?

369
19:15.090 --> 19:16.150
I'm older than you!

370
19:16.420 --> 19:17.680
Whatever.

371
19:18.030 --> 19:18.920
With your broken leg,

372
19:18.920 --> 19:19.830
you're still messing around.

373
19:19.830 --> 19:21.640
Who else would break a leg if not you?

374
19:21.640 --> 19:22.640
Serves you right.

375
19:22.940 --> 19:23.880
The doctor said I could

376
19:23.880 --> 19:24.380
get this cast off

377
19:24.380 --> 19:25.140
in just a few days.

378
19:25.140 --> 19:25.480
And then,

379
19:25.480 --> 19:27.240
I'll be a man as free as the wind again.

380
19:27.240 --> 19:28.640
Or as free as a lunatic.

381
19:29.480 --> 19:30.920
Lili is away.

382
19:30.920 --> 19:32.530
Are you bored?

383
19:34.310 --> 19:35.480
Lili's only gone back home for a few days.

384
19:35.480 --> 19:37.480
It's not like she's not coming back.

385
19:37.830 --> 19:40.530
She's pretty, and that's why she seduces people.

386
19:40.530 --> 19:41.270
So

387
19:41.270 --> 19:42.640
Lili went back to Xifu because of what

388
19:42.640 --> 19:43.640
happened online?

389
19:43.810 --> 19:45.010
What else could it be?

390
19:45.270 --> 19:45.860
I thought

391
19:45.880 --> 19:47.480
she had a fight with my uncle.

392
19:47.680 --> 19:49.290
They are doing just fine.

393
19:49.830 --> 19:50.770
How do you know?

394
19:51.010 --> 19:52.320
I am omniscient.

395
19:55.700 --> 19:56.420
Seriously, how can

396
19:56.420 --> 19:58.240
these netizens be so brainless?

397
19:58.240 --> 20:00.170
They believe whatever others say!

398
20:00.440 --> 20:02.480
I really hate this kind of cyberbullying.

399
20:02.480 --> 20:03.180
They made things up

400
20:03.180 --> 20:04.480
and twisted the truth.

401
20:11.610 --> 20:12.270
No way.

402
20:12.270 --> 20:14.130
I'm going to ask my uncle about it.

403
20:22.140 --> 20:23.010
Oh, my God.

404
20:23.440 --> 20:24.240
Zhengchu.

405
20:25.380 --> 20:26.180
Uncle.

406
20:26.720 --> 20:27.440
Perfect timing.

407
20:27.440 --> 20:28.570
I need to talk to you.

408
20:29.400 --> 20:30.640
It's about Lili, right?

409
20:30.640 --> 20:31.270
Yes.

410
20:32.660 --> 20:33.500
Now we need

411
20:33.530 --> 20:34.480
to find out

412
20:34.480 --> 20:35.740
who is behind all this.

413
20:35.770 --> 20:36.360
I checked

414
20:36.390 --> 20:37.640
some related information online

415
20:37.640 --> 20:39.510
and found that this person probably has

416
20:39.510 --> 20:40.840
multiple alt accounts.

417
20:41.010 --> 20:41.810
But, Uncle,

418
20:42.220 --> 20:43.880
people who spread rumors online like this

419
20:43.880 --> 20:44.420
are bound

420
20:44.420 --> 20:45.680
to cover their tracks.

421
20:46.360 --> 20:47.210
How about

422
20:47.240 --> 20:48.940
I get someone to track them down?

423
20:48.940 --> 20:49.720
I have a few friends

424
20:49.720 --> 20:51.380
who are pros in this area.

425
20:53.330 --> 20:53.980
If we can find

426
20:53.980 --> 20:55.610
the connections between the accounts

427
20:55.610 --> 20:56.680
and pinpoint

428
20:56.830 --> 20:57.740
their IP addresses

429
20:57.740 --> 20:59.110
as well as posting times,

430
20:59.110 --> 21:00.920
we should be able to narrow it down.

431
21:00.920 --> 21:02.120
If that doesn't work,

432
21:03.030 --> 21:03.830
we can investigate

433
21:03.830 --> 21:05.490
their relationship with EAW.

434
21:06.810 --> 21:07.610
Uncle,

435
21:07.630 --> 21:09.000
you mean

436
21:09.030 --> 21:11.760
it has something to do with people in the company?

437
21:12.110 --> 21:13.420
Just do as I said for now.

438
21:13.420 --> 21:14.220
Okay.

439
21:14.450 --> 21:15.330
You can rest assured

440
21:15.330 --> 21:16.480
leaving this to me.

441
21:16.480 --> 21:17.310
Those friends of mine

442
21:17.310 --> 21:18.440
owe me a big favor.

443
21:18.440 --> 21:19.610
If I ask them for help, they'll

444
21:19.610 --> 21:20.870
definitely handle it.

445
21:22.640 --> 21:23.610
But, Uncle,

446
21:23.610 --> 21:26.380
have you thought about going to check in on Lili?

447
21:26.480 --> 21:28.880
She must've been very sad the past few days.

448
21:39.270 --> 21:40.070
Hello, Li.

449
21:40.420 --> 21:41.180
It's dinner time.

450
21:41.180 --> 21:43.110
Why are you still not back for dinner?

451
21:43.110 --> 21:44.440
I'm working part-time.

452
21:44.440 --> 21:45.570
Working part-time?

453
21:46.330 --> 21:47.480
How many times have I told you

454
21:47.480 --> 21:48.590
to focus on your studies?

455
21:48.590 --> 21:49.750
I know. I got it.

456
21:50.200 --> 21:50.550
Li,

457
21:50.550 --> 21:51.900
please don't tell Dad.

458
21:52.420 --> 21:53.440
Send me your address now.

459
21:53.440 --> 21:54.370
I'll go meet you.

460
21:54.610 --> 21:55.530
I'm at work.

461
21:55.530 --> 21:56.810
What are you coming to me for?

462
21:56.810 --> 21:57.740
Just send it to me,

463
21:57.740 --> 21:59.070
or I'll tell Mom and Dad.

464
21:59.220 --> 22:00.010
No, please.

465
22:00.240 --> 22:01.700
I'll send it! I'll send it!

466
22:09.370 --> 22:10.940
Dear, dinner is ready.

467
22:11.600 --> 22:13.450
Lili, time for dinner!

468
22:21.570 --> 22:22.240
Mom,

469
22:22.240 --> 22:23.330
I'm heading out for a bit.

470
22:23.330 --> 22:25.220
You're heading out without even eating?

471
22:25.220 --> 22:27.010
Your mom has already made dinner.

472
22:27.010 --> 22:28.540
Why are you going out to eat?

473
22:28.940 --> 22:30.670
Yun Ye is treating me to dinner.

474
22:31.220 --> 22:32.030
They haven't hung out alone

475
22:32.030 --> 22:33.180
for quite a while.

476
22:33.180 --> 22:33.830
Just go ahead.

477
22:33.830 --> 22:34.610
Thanks, Mom.

478
22:36.640 --> 22:37.920
Do you have enough money?

479
22:37.920 --> 22:39.010
Yes, he pays.

480
22:39.680 --> 22:41.140
You're just spoiling her.

481
22:43.270 --> 22:45.000
She'll grow up sooner or later.

482
22:49.330 --> 22:50.460
Here you are, Yun Li.

483
22:50.830 --> 22:51.880
Here, eat up.

484
22:54.940 --> 22:56.740
What? Are you trying to bribe me?

485
22:57.030 --> 22:58.030
Just take whatever

486
22:58.030 --> 22:58.940
you want to eat.

487
22:59.830 --> 23:02.010
It's rare for you to be so generous.

488
23:02.530 --> 23:04.330
Too bad I don't have much of an appetite.

489
23:04.330 --> 23:05.420
What's wrong?

490
23:05.740 --> 23:06.870
Are you in a bad mood?

491
23:06.980 --> 23:07.770
Nope.

492
23:07.980 --> 23:08.770
I'm fine.

493
23:09.680 --> 23:10.610
You're fine?

494
23:11.830 --> 23:13.810
Then give me a smile.

495
23:14.940 --> 23:15.940
Keep pulling a long face,

496
23:15.940 --> 23:17.340
and you'll get wrinkles.

497
23:18.220 --> 23:19.880
You also get them if you smile.

498
23:20.270 --> 23:21.070
Never mind.

499
23:21.530 --> 23:22.640
If you really can't smile,

500
23:22.640 --> 23:23.610
just forget about it.

501
23:23.610 --> 23:25.610
You look worse smiling than crying.

502
23:25.960 --> 23:27.000
Pardon?

503
23:32.720 --> 23:33.510
Li.

504
23:34.310 --> 23:35.110
If there's something

505
23:35.110 --> 23:35.940
you don't want to tell Mom and Dad,

506
23:35.940 --> 23:37.010
you can keep it from them.

507
23:37.010 --> 23:39.010
But you don't have to hide it from me.

508
23:39.110 --> 23:39.980
Just tell me!

509
23:40.240 --> 23:41.010
Which jerk is it?

510
23:41.010 --> 23:42.410
I'll get revenge for you.

511
23:42.680 --> 23:44.340
W-What are you talking about?

512
23:44.720 --> 23:45.920
You can't fool me.

513
23:45.920 --> 23:48.320
You must be having relationship problems.

514
23:49.240 --> 23:50.810
I have sharp eyes.

515
23:52.310 --> 23:53.680
Have you finished your homework?

516
23:53.680 --> 23:54.570
Have you reviewed your lessons?

517
23:54.570 --> 23:56.610
What was your score on the mock exam this time?

518
23:56.610 --> 23:57.420
Li!

519
23:57.770 --> 23:59.030
Look at the way you are.

520
23:59.240 --> 24:01.300
I definitely hit the nail on the head.

521
24:04.290 --> 24:05.180
Just tell me

522
24:05.180 --> 24:06.240
which jerk

523
24:06.240 --> 24:07.240
broke your heart!

524
24:07.740 --> 24:09.920
Kid, don't be so gossipy.

525
24:09.920 --> 24:10.530
No, no,

526
24:10.530 --> 24:11.510
I'm not gossiping.

527
24:11.510 --> 24:13.110
I'm worried about you!

528
24:13.110 --> 24:14.200
Just tell me...

529
24:19.310 --> 24:20.640
What are you looking at?

530
24:26.340 --> 24:27.800
Brat, who is that?

531
24:29.030 --> 24:30.420
Just a friend of mine.

532
24:30.420 --> 24:30.810
Your friend?

533
24:30.810 --> 24:33.010
Your friend is waiting for you outside?

534
24:34.030 --> 24:34.880
There's nothing between us.

535
24:34.880 --> 24:35.510
Ask no more.

536
24:35.510 --> 24:36.110
This is fishy.

537
24:36.110 --> 24:36.510
Tell me.

538
24:36.510 --> 24:37.220
Come on.

539
24:49.620 --> 24:51.220
That's my sister in the shop.

540
24:59.880 --> 25:00.680
Yunyi?

541
25:05.940 --> 25:08.010
Why didn't you go straight home after school?

542
25:08.010 --> 25:09.340
What are you doing here?

543
25:10.610 --> 25:12.010
I came to grab some stuff.

544
25:13.310 --> 25:14.180
And this is...

545
25:16.030 --> 25:17.810
This is my classmate, Yun Ye.

546
25:18.860 --> 25:20.880
This is my brother, Yin Yucheng.

547
25:21.100 --> 25:21.900
Hello.

548
25:25.940 --> 25:26.940
Who is that?

549
25:27.640 --> 25:28.310
Your classmate is

550
25:28.310 --> 25:30.710
working part-time at a convenience store?

551
25:31.120 --> 25:32.720
High school studies are so demanding.

552
25:32.720 --> 25:34.420
How do you still have time to work part-time?

553
25:34.420 --> 25:36.750
Didn't your family say anything about it?

554
25:39.140 --> 25:39.940
Yun Ye!

555
25:41.270 --> 25:41.940
Li.

556
25:46.010 --> 25:46.720
Hello,

557
25:46.720 --> 25:49.030
I'm Yun Ye's sister, Yun Li.

558
25:51.180 --> 25:51.980
Hello.

559
25:52.310 --> 25:55.610
I'm Yunyi's brother, Yin Yucheng.

560
25:59.380 --> 26:00.310
Nice to meet you.

561
26:02.640 --> 26:03.930
Yunyi just finished class.

562
26:03.930 --> 26:05.010
I happened to pass by

563
26:05.010 --> 26:06.510
and saw her at the convenience store,

564
26:06.510 --> 26:08.040
so I came over to take a look.

565
26:08.530 --> 26:09.980
Are Yunyi and Yun Ye

566
26:10.140 --> 26:11.380
in the same class?

567
26:11.510 --> 26:14.170
We're in the same school but different classes.

568
26:14.720 --> 26:16.370
We just ran into each other

569
26:17.010 --> 26:18.140
and met not long ago.

570
26:18.140 --> 26:19.480
Yun Ye gets great grades.

571
26:19.480 --> 26:20.070
Our teacher

572
26:20.070 --> 26:21.730
praises him from time to time.

573
26:23.420 --> 26:24.350
Yun Ye's sister,

574
26:24.680 --> 26:25.680
would you mind

575
26:26.310 --> 26:27.770
exchanging contact info?

576
26:28.220 --> 26:29.030
It seems that Yunyi

577
26:29.030 --> 26:30.530
has made a very nice friend.

578
26:30.530 --> 26:32.430
We may as well add each other on WeChat

579
26:32.430 --> 26:35.030
to make it easier to communicate in the future.

580
26:40.240 --> 26:41.500
I'll scan your QR code.

581
26:46.420 --> 26:47.880
Then I will leave you to it.

582
26:48.240 --> 26:49.300
I'll take my leave.

583
27:14.660 --> 27:15.590
Still staring?

584
27:16.030 --> 27:17.490
They're already far away.

585
27:18.300 --> 27:19.300
I wasn't staring.

586
27:19.850 --> 27:21.050
You weren't staring? Your eyes

587
27:21.050 --> 27:22.980
were literally glued to their car!

588
27:23.240 --> 27:24.240
Yun Ye, I'm warning you.

589
27:24.240 --> 27:25.440
No dating at your age.

590
27:25.960 --> 27:27.050
I already told you there was

591
27:27.050 --> 27:27.790
nothing between us.

592
27:27.790 --> 27:29.030
We're just classmates.

593
27:29.030 --> 27:30.400
There better be nothing.

594
27:30.400 --> 27:32.060
Anyway, no dating at your age.

595
27:32.850 --> 27:34.180
And no working, either.

596
27:35.070 --> 27:35.550
Li.

597
27:35.790 --> 27:36.590
Li, Li...

598
27:36.790 --> 27:38.330
Li! Listen to me, Li.

599
27:39.590 --> 27:40.440
Everything's settled

600
27:40.440 --> 27:41.570
with my job in Nanwu.

601
27:41.910 --> 27:43.070
Pack your things.

602
27:43.590 --> 27:45.050
We're getting ready to go.

603
27:45.750 --> 27:46.810
When?

604
27:47.240 --> 27:48.300
In a couple of days.

605
27:52.440 --> 27:54.250
I think Xifu is pretty good.

606
27:54.920 --> 27:55.400
It'll surely

607
27:55.400 --> 27:57.020
take you a while to get used to a new place.

608
27:57.020 --> 27:58.220
But Nanwu definitely offers

609
27:58.220 --> 27:59.350
much better education

610
27:59.350 --> 28:01.210
and living conditions than Xifu.

611
28:02.090 --> 28:03.290
You'll like it there.

612
28:06.000 --> 28:07.200
You're going into your senior year.

613
28:07.200 --> 28:07.960
You need to fully focus

614
28:07.960 --> 28:08.940
on your studies.

615
28:09.200 --> 28:11.330
Don't let anything else distract you.

616
28:27.200 --> 28:28.330
Where are you going?

617
28:29.460 --> 28:30.240
The library.

618
28:30.740 --> 28:32.150
The library?

619
28:33.480 --> 28:34.940
You're not going on a date?

620
28:35.700 --> 28:36.880
Nope.

621
28:36.940 --> 28:38.540
Not going to work part-time?

622
28:38.740 --> 28:39.310
Nope.

623
28:40.400 --> 28:41.000
For real?

624
28:41.900 --> 28:44.000
Look at you, all dressed up in new clothes!

625
28:44.000 --> 28:45.550
You even styled your hair, right?

626
28:45.550 --> 28:46.290
I don't quite believe you.

627
28:46.290 --> 28:46.960
Let me see if there are

628
28:46.960 --> 28:47.610
books in your bag.

629
28:47.610 --> 28:48.880
I told you I'm not going on a date.

630
28:48.880 --> 28:49.480
Wait.

631
28:50.550 --> 28:51.290
Stay still.

632
28:51.400 --> 28:52.530
I won't run. I won't.

633
28:52.530 --> 28:53.550
Hello, Jiameng.

634
28:53.940 --> 28:54.740
What's up?

635
28:55.240 --> 28:56.500
Sorry, Yun Li.

636
28:56.530 --> 28:57.350
You're on leave,

637
28:57.350 --> 28:58.420
and I'm still bothering you.

638
28:58.420 --> 28:59.220
It's fine.

639
28:59.460 --> 29:00.260
Just go ahead.

640
29:00.590 --> 29:02.440
The company is sending someone

641
29:02.440 --> 29:04.170
to Xifu to give a presentation.

642
29:04.390 --> 29:06.490
The boss asked me to choose an assistant to go along.

643
29:06.490 --> 29:08.020
I've asked several people,

644
29:08.090 --> 29:09.840
but they either don't have time

645
29:10.030 --> 29:12.000
or are afraid of the person in charge.

646
29:12.000 --> 29:13.330
They all turned me down.

647
29:13.400 --> 29:14.930
I really had no other choice

648
29:14.930 --> 29:16.370
and had to turn to you.

649
29:17.290 --> 29:19.330
Who is the person in charge?

650
29:19.640 --> 29:20.680
Engineer Fu.

651
29:21.350 --> 29:23.330
Are you available?

652
29:24.140 --> 29:24.940
Don't worry!

653
29:24.940 --> 29:26.100
You won't work for nothing.

654
29:26.100 --> 29:28.230
Ms. Fang will record your attendance.

655
29:28.550 --> 29:29.790
Please do me a favor.

656
29:31.960 --> 29:33.290
I-I got it. Fine by me.

657
29:33.770 --> 29:34.920
Thank you, Yun Li.

658
29:35.330 --> 29:36.050
By the way,

659
29:36.050 --> 29:36.750
the new VR equipment

660
29:36.750 --> 29:37.740
we're bringing this time

661
29:37.740 --> 29:38.290
also needs to be

662
29:38.290 --> 29:39.960
filmed for the new game's promo clip.

663
29:39.960 --> 29:41.620
Please arrange it. Thank you.

664
29:54.720 --> 29:55.330
Grandma.

665
29:55.720 --> 29:56.350
Are you tired?

666
29:56.350 --> 29:57.050
Nope.

667
29:57.790 --> 29:58.820
Let's sit and rest for a bit.

668
29:58.820 --> 29:59.310
Okay.

669
29:59.340 --> 30:00.600
Have something to eat.

670
30:10.830 --> 30:11.400
Grandma.

671
30:12.630 --> 30:13.560
Pineapple cake?

672
30:15.750 --> 30:17.480
Your favorite pineapple cake.

673
30:27.570 --> 30:28.240
How is it?

674
30:28.590 --> 30:29.530
Any change in the taste?

675
30:29.530 --> 30:30.330
Nope.

676
30:31.060 --> 30:32.480
It tastes just as good.

677
30:47.740 --> 30:49.090
The pineapple cake

678
30:50.340 --> 30:51.650
has

679
30:51.670 --> 30:53.630
a thick, crispy crust outside

680
30:54.250 --> 30:55.700
and a soft filling

681
30:56.050 --> 30:57.570
inside.

682
30:59.140 --> 31:01.290
Isn't it just like some people?

683
31:02.350 --> 31:04.610
Tough on the outside, soft on the inside.

684
31:10.240 --> 31:11.200
Without

685
31:11.200 --> 31:14.090
this crust

686
31:14.090 --> 31:15.750
wrapping around the filling,

687
31:17.120 --> 31:18.650
it wouldn't hold its shape.

688
31:19.790 --> 31:22.400
A pineapple cake can't be all filling.

689
31:23.970 --> 31:25.890
So we can't blame people

690
31:26.300 --> 31:29.360
for wrapping themselves in a shell.

691
31:30.000 --> 31:31.330
But if they do,

692
31:31.550 --> 31:32.500
it must be because

693
31:32.500 --> 31:34.050
they've been hurt before.

694
31:34.790 --> 31:36.000
That's why they

695
31:36.000 --> 31:39.010
hide their soft hearts.

696
31:42.050 --> 31:43.580
That's just the way you are,

697
31:44.010 --> 31:44.810
Shize.

698
31:52.940 --> 31:53.550
Grandma?

699
31:55.180 --> 31:55.940
Shize.

700
31:59.300 --> 32:00.640
I'm clear-headed now.

701
32:02.700 --> 32:04.900
I can feel that you're unhappy.

702
32:11.330 --> 32:12.480
You know what?

703
32:12.880 --> 32:14.290
A hard shell

704
32:14.660 --> 32:15.470
sometimes

705
32:15.880 --> 32:18.000
can protect you well.

706
32:18.830 --> 32:20.400
But it can also hurt

707
32:20.740 --> 32:23.280
those who truly want to get close to you.

708
32:26.030 --> 32:27.480
I hope that you

709
32:27.830 --> 32:29.330
can be yourself.

710
32:30.330 --> 32:32.500
Go after what you want,

711
32:32.900 --> 32:34.880
and say so when you like something.

712
32:35.500 --> 32:37.590
Let's not beat around the bush.

713
32:38.560 --> 32:40.540
All that going in circles

714
32:40.730 --> 32:42.450
might make you

715
32:42.480 --> 32:43.940
lose your good fortune.

716
32:44.390 --> 32:45.450
When that happens,

717
32:45.830 --> 32:47.720
it'll be too late to regret.

718
32:50.920 --> 32:51.720
Grandma.

719
32:54.930 --> 32:56.020
But I'm scared.

720
32:56.790 --> 32:57.980
Scared of what?

721
32:59.320 --> 33:01.320
Scared of being rejected,

722
33:01.480 --> 33:02.530
or scared of

723
33:03.140 --> 33:04.800
exposing your true feelings?

724
33:06.430 --> 33:07.240
I'm scared...

725
33:11.640 --> 33:13.370
I'm scared I'm not good enough.

726
33:13.740 --> 33:15.660
That's just what you think,

727
33:15.660 --> 33:16.510
Shize.

728
33:17.790 --> 33:20.030
Don't leave yourself with regrets.

729
33:22.200 --> 33:23.000
I see.

730
33:24.460 --> 33:25.260
Look,

731
33:25.380 --> 33:27.240
how time flies.

732
33:27.530 --> 33:30.440
In the blink of an eye, you've all grown up

733
33:30.900 --> 33:32.700
and gotten so tall.

734
33:33.330 --> 33:35.500
You're busy all day long,

735
33:35.590 --> 33:36.790
with no time

736
33:37.240 --> 33:38.940
to spend with me.

737
33:42.400 --> 33:43.660
Don't worry, Grandma.

738
33:45.570 --> 33:47.170
I'll always be here with you.

739
33:48.000 --> 33:49.860
I don't need you to be here with me.

740
33:50.500 --> 33:52.180
I just want you to be happy

741
33:52.770 --> 33:54.270
every day

742
33:54.380 --> 33:56.290
and have someone by your side.

743
33:56.500 --> 33:58.030
I'm long in the tooth,

744
33:58.380 --> 34:00.290
and my memory isn't as good as it used to be.

745
34:00.290 --> 34:01.700
I'm always forgetting

746
34:01.700 --> 34:03.180
things.

747
34:03.530 --> 34:05.330
You young people are different.

748
34:05.570 --> 34:07.270
You have your own lives.

749
34:07.740 --> 34:09.070
All I want is for you

750
34:09.659 --> 34:10.530
to live

751
34:10.560 --> 34:11.840
your life well.

752
34:12.170 --> 34:14.230
You don't have to stay with me all day.

753
34:15.630 --> 34:16.440
Grandma,

754
34:17.530 --> 34:19.070
I want to stay with you.

755
34:21.480 --> 34:22.270
Shize,

756
34:23.030 --> 34:24.690
you're such a good boy.

757
34:28.030 --> 34:29.570
It's about time.

758
34:30.050 --> 34:30.570
Come on,

759
34:30.630 --> 34:32.130
let's go back and eat.

760
34:35.480 --> 34:36.030
Let's go.

761
34:39.900 --> 34:40.429
Let's go.

762
34:44.350 --> 34:45.120
It's so good.

763
34:51.690 --> 34:52.230
Done.

764
34:52.380 --> 34:53.840
Thank you. Have a good day.

765
34:56.820 --> 34:58.590
Hello, welcome.

766
35:10.420 --> 35:11.260
Yun Ye.

767
35:12.870 --> 35:15.400
You'll have to work hard on your own next semester.

768
35:15.400 --> 35:16.190
Why?

769
35:17.570 --> 35:19.630
I'm transferring to another school.

770
35:19.900 --> 35:21.900
Transferring? Where are you going?

771
35:22.340 --> 35:23.170
Nanwu.

772
35:24.280 --> 35:25.480
Nanwu?

773
35:26.870 --> 35:29.370
When are you leaving then?

774
35:30.530 --> 35:31.340
Tomorrow.

775
35:32.170 --> 35:33.780
S-So soon?

776
35:40.000 --> 35:40.800
Well, then...

777
35:42.070 --> 35:43.030
Is this our last time

778
35:43.030 --> 35:44.380
seeing each other?

779
35:52.770 --> 35:53.630
It's fine.

780
35:53.960 --> 35:55.420
Nanwu isn't that far away.

781
35:55.500 --> 35:56.590
Anyway, remember to ask me

782
35:56.590 --> 35:58.510
if you have any problems with English.

783
35:58.510 --> 36:00.160
My English is pretty good.

784
36:04.600 --> 36:07.930
Occasionally, there are some questions I'm not sure about.

785
36:14.000 --> 36:14.940
I've got to go.

786
36:15.570 --> 36:17.500
My brother is still waiting for me.

787
36:18.190 --> 36:19.850
Then how do we stay in contact?

788
36:21.730 --> 36:23.130
You can write me letters.

789
36:24.190 --> 36:25.260
Write letters?

790
36:41.940 --> 36:43.120
Don't let me find you.

791
36:43.120 --> 36:44.450
How dare you bully Lili?

792
36:44.530 --> 36:46.660
I'll tear you into pieces if I find you.

793
36:48.170 --> 36:49.630
They're all alt accounts.

794
36:49.640 --> 36:51.040
How can I find the person?

795
36:52.250 --> 36:53.380
If that doesn't work,

796
36:53.380 --> 36:54.170
we can investigate

797
36:54.170 --> 36:55.830
their relationship with EAW.

798
36:57.610 --> 36:59.240
People related...

799
37:00.000 --> 37:01.570
to EAW.

800
37:08.230 --> 37:09.380
Hello, Feifei.

801
37:09.590 --> 37:10.400
Zhengchu,

802
37:10.590 --> 37:11.840
do you want to come and hang out tonight?

803
37:11.840 --> 37:13.770
We can celebrate your discharge from the hospital.

804
37:13.770 --> 37:15.340
My foot hasn't fully healed yet.

805
37:15.340 --> 37:16.600
I'll take a rain check.

806
37:18.250 --> 37:19.060
Fine,

807
37:19.090 --> 37:20.130
then let's hang out

808
37:20.130 --> 37:20.920
when your leg is better.

809
37:20.920 --> 37:21.460
Okay.

810
37:32.940 --> 37:34.270
Feng Feifei?

811
37:36.000 --> 37:37.200
Let's start with you.

812
37:37.910 --> 37:39.020
This is great.

813
37:39.040 --> 37:40.030
The one who planned this event

814
37:40.030 --> 37:41.170
is so talented.

815
37:45.190 --> 37:46.420
Eat all of this.

816
37:50.540 --> 37:51.380
This is a large portion.

817
37:51.380 --> 37:52.430
Are you feeding an army?

818
37:52.430 --> 37:54.100
You are what you eat.

819
37:54.130 --> 37:54.940
Just eat up.

820
37:56.010 --> 37:56.500
Such nourishment

821
37:56.500 --> 37:57.690
is too much.

822
37:58.670 --> 37:59.380
People say

823
37:59.380 --> 38:01.730
it takes 100 days to recover from a bone injury.

824
38:01.730 --> 38:02.670
If you want to get better soon,

825
38:02.670 --> 38:03.750
just eat it all.

826
38:34.910 --> 38:36.200
From Nanwu to Xifu,

827
38:36.230 --> 38:37.730
there are 4 flights a day.

828
38:38.980 --> 38:39.690
How do I know

829
38:39.690 --> 38:41.150
which flight he's taking?

830
38:43.280 --> 38:44.410
The morning flight?

831
38:44.440 --> 38:45.280
That's too early.

832
38:45.280 --> 38:46.230
N-No way.

833
38:47.280 --> 38:48.920
If I were him, I would take...

834
38:49.380 --> 38:50.380
the noon flight.

835
38:51.480 --> 38:53.340
But what if he just takes the morning flight?

836
38:53.340 --> 38:55.200
Then I won't be able to pick him up.

837
38:59.260 --> 38:59.840
Forget it.

838
38:59.840 --> 39:00.940
It's only 5 hours.

839
39:22.980 --> 39:25.230
The next flight is in 2 hours.

840
39:26.480 --> 39:27.280
I'll wait.

841
39:27.900 --> 39:29.700
I've already waited for 3 hours.

842
39:58.530 --> 40:00.060
Jiameng must have told you.

843
40:00.630 --> 40:02.500
I'll be the assistant for the presentation.

844
40:02.500 --> 40:04.100
I'm here to pick you up today.

845
40:06.730 --> 40:07.500
I...

846
40:10.070 --> 40:12.000
I didn't tell her my flight number.

847
40:13.980 --> 40:15.160
I-I parked my car over there.

848
40:15.160 --> 40:15.700
Let's go.

849
40:38.040 --> 40:39.820
You can rest in the passenger seat.

850
40:39.820 --> 40:40.530
I'll drive.

851
40:42.340 --> 40:42.940
Mm.

852
40:54.630 --> 40:56.030
Are we going to the hotel?

853
40:56.780 --> 40:58.040
Let's go to XUST first.

854
41:21.570 --> 41:22.340
Is there any work

855
41:22.340 --> 41:23.320
you need me to do?

856
41:28.320 --> 41:29.480
I've got all the materials ready

857
41:29.480 --> 41:30.810
for this presentation.

858
41:32.140 --> 41:34.240
Please format the materials, design the cover,

859
41:34.240 --> 41:35.670
and contact a print shop to have them printed and bound.

860
41:35.670 --> 41:36.920
We need 100 copies in total.

861
41:36.920 --> 41:37.510
Okay.

862
41:38.040 --> 41:39.370
Is there anything else?

863
41:46.860 --> 41:48.110
I'll get some sleep first.

864
41:48.110 --> 41:49.510
Wake me up when we arrive.

865
41:56.250 --> 41:56.960
Shize,

866
41:58.110 --> 41:59.500
I hope that you

867
42:00.050 --> 42:01.320
can be yourself.

868
42:02.570 --> 42:04.980
Say so when you like something.

869
42:05.940 --> 42:08.080
Let's not beat around the bush.

870
42:09.320 --> 42:11.230
All that going in circles

871
42:11.390 --> 42:13.140
might make you

872
42:13.170 --> 42:14.630
lose your good fortune.

873
42:15.490 --> 42:16.550
When that happens,

874
42:16.820 --> 42:18.510
it'll be too late to regret.

875
42:20.080 --> 42:22.170
Don't leave yourself with regrets.

876
43:35.610 --> 43:37.050
We've reached XUST?

877
43:38.650 --> 43:39.260
Mm.

878
43:43.340 --> 43:45.140
I slept here for an hour?

879
43:46.980 --> 43:47.610
Nope.

880
43:47.930 --> 43:49.260
There was a traffic jam.

881
43:52.510 --> 43:53.610
I'll get going then.

882
43:53.610 --> 43:55.470
You may go straight home and rest.

883
43:56.550 --> 43:58.010
It's inconvenient for you to carry your luggage.

884
43:58.010 --> 43:59.870
Let me take it to the hotel for you.

885
44:01.110 --> 44:01.910
Don't bother.

886
44:01.980 --> 44:02.780
It's nothing.

887
44:03.460 --> 44:04.550
I'll leave it at the front desk.

888
44:04.550 --> 44:06.090
You can pick it up when you get there.

889
44:06.090 --> 44:06.900
Go ahead.

890
44:09.440 --> 44:10.040
Thank you.
